  - m_Id: 5221716635267075
    m_Localized: Bare Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267076
    m_Localized: There is nothing you can't do with this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267077
    m_Localized: Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267078
    m_Localized: It is a very basic sword.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267079
    m_Localized: Wooden Bow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267080
    m_Localized: It's decent enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267081
    m_Localized: Wooden Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267082
    m_Localized: How scary!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716635267083
    m_Localized: AK47
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221716639461376
    m_Localized: With just this one thing, my grandmother could have become a legend
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191309283328
    m_Localized: Slow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837760
    m_Localized: Slows the target's movement speed by {v0}% for {d0} seconds.
