    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837764
    m_Localized: Inflicts <color=#00BBFF>Frostbite</color> effect on the target for
      {d0} seconds, reducing their attack speed by {v1}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837765
    m_Localized: Judgment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837766
    m_Localized: When hitting, deals additional <b>fixed damage equal to {v0}% of
