    m_Localized: Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183922171932
    m_Localized: "Skills \u2014 cast on release"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183922171933
    m_Localized: If you turn it off, it will be used the moment you press it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183922171934
    m_Localized: "Dash \u2014 toward where you look"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183922171935
    m_Localized: Turning it off makes you dash in the direction you are moving (only
      dashes in the direction of movement)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183922171936
    m_Localized: Pick up weapons automatically
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183922171937
