      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560571
    m_Localized: Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560572
    m_Localized: "Bow \xB7 Staff"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560573
    m_Localized: Melee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560574
    m_Localized: '[Same crosshair for all weapons] is enabled, so all weapons use
      the gun crosshair.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560575
    m_Localized: Change preview background
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560576
    m_Localized: View spreading movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560577
    m_Localized: Copy code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560578
    m_Localized: Paste code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560579
    m_Localized: Reset this weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560580
    m_Localized: Apply to all weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560581
    m_Localized: Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560582
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560583
    m_Localized: Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560584
    m_Localized: Leave room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15217183930560585
    m_Localized: Quit game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945284591616
    m_Localized: On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340352
    m_Localized: Off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534723
    m_Localized: Versatile incompetence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534725
    m_Localized: Versatile incompetence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534726
    m_Localized: Surprisingly ordinary and incompetent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340353
    m_Localized: blacksmith
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340354
    m_Localized: 'You are the blacksmith.


      The enchantment limit for weapon
      items increases to 100.


      You can spend Soul to set the next enchantment
      to a desired value.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340356
    m_Localized: 'The enchantment limit increases to 100.


      You can specify
      the value of the next enchantment by consuming Soul.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340357
    m_Localized: a well-trained body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340358
    m_Localized: 'Your body is suitable for bellows work.


      HP + {0:all}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340359
    m_Localized: Crushing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340360
    m_Localized: Swing a hammer forward to deal {dmg:SmashCoef+SmashFlat} damage
      and stun enemies hit for 0.25 seconds. Additionally, enemies hit have their
      armor reduced by {b:ArmorBreakPct}% for 5 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340361
    m_Localized: blast furnace eruption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340363
    m_Localized: It reaches maximum power when HP drops to 30%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340364
    m_Localized: Descendants of Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340365
    m_Localized: 'For {b:UltDuration} seconds, your body is enveloped in fire, becoming
      ''Descendant of Fire''.


      Enemies that strike you with melee attacks
      gain the Burn effect, and all item effects are increased by 25%. Additionally,
      the cooldown of ''Furnace Burst'' is reset every time your health drops by
      15%, such as at 85%, 70%, 55%, etc.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340366
    m_Localized: While in 'Descendant of Fire' state, the amount of Enchant Stones
      required for Enchant is reduced by half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340367
    m_Localized: Gun Master
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340369
    m_Localized: Gun Enchantment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340370
    m_Localized: You can enchant firearms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340372
    m_Localized: "When equipped with a firearm, Attack Speed \u200B\u200Bincreases
      by {0}% and Movement Speed \u200B\u200Bby {1}, and Critical Damage increases
      by an additional {2}%.\n\nThe default weapon becomes 'Glock'."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340373
    m_Localized: roll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340374
    m_Localized: 'Roll forward to enter Evasion for 1 second.


      Replenish ammo
      by 20%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340375
    m_Localized: precision shooting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340376
    m_Localized: 'Zoom in for {b:AimTimeout} seconds and slow your movement speed.


      Instead,
      the next bullet deals {b:AimBonusPct:all}% additional damage on hit and always
      hits critically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340377
    m_Localized: Go into the bathroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340378
    m_Localized: "Enter 'Spray' for 12 seconds, increasing your attack speed by {b:UltAtkSpeedPct:all}%
      and granting 20% \u200B\u200Blifesteal. During the duration, instead of ricocheting
      {b:UltRicochets:all} times off walls, your bullet spread increases by 30%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340379
    m_Localized: Death Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340380
    m_Localized: 'You are someone who died long ago but has returned for some reason.


      A
      Death Knight''s abilities change according to the ''name'' assigned to them.


      You
      might have been just a peasant, or you might have been a great man.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340383
    m_Localized: 'Current Name : {x:nametag}


      Additional Stats : {x:stats}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340384
    m_Localized: The body of the deceased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340385
    m_Localized: When your health reaches 50%, you enter 'Ghost' status for {b:GhostTime}
      seconds and ignore all physical hitboxes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340386
    m_Localized: Sword of the Underworld
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340387
    m_Localized: Slash forward with evil power, dealing {dmg:SlashCoef+SlashFlat}
      damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340388
    m_Localized: '{x:slash}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340389
    m_Localized: riding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340390
    m_Localized: 'Mount an undead horse for {b:MountDuration} seconds. While mounted,
      your movement speed increases by {b:MountSpeed} and damage taken is reduced
      by {b:MountDamageReduce}%.


      Reuse while mounted to dash forward rapidly,
      dealing {dmg:ChargeCoef} damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340391
    m_Localized: '{x:mount}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340394
    m_Localized: '{x:ult}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340395
    m_Localized: glutton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340396
    m_Localized: 'You are hungry.


      And you have a stomach that can swallow
      anything.


      You can swallow anything and become a massive being.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340397
    m_Localized: digestion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340398
    m_Localized: glutton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340399
    m_Localized: 'Eat a weapon to permanently gain {b:AbsorbRatio:pct}% of your ability
      points.


      {x:digest}


      {x:absorbed}


      {x:specials}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340400
    m_Localized: "You gain based on Weapon Base Stat \xD7 Absorb Ratio {b:AbsorbRatio*100:all}%
      \xD7 Grade Multiplier.\n\nYou can gain up to {b:AbsorbEnchants*100:all}% of
      Enchantment Effects, and consuming special weapons grants a permanent special
      effect.\n\nDigestion time is reduced by up to {b:DigestMul*100}% depending
      on the skill level."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340402
    m_Localized: Bite forward to deal {dmg:DevourCoef+DevourFlat} damage. If the
      damaged target dies within 1 second, gain an additional soul and prepare <b>Spit
      Out</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340403
    m_Localized: Recovers health equal to {b:DevourHealPct}% of the damage dealt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340406
    m_Localized: 'The base damage is {dmg:SpitCoef+SpitFlat}, and deals additional
      damage equal to {b:InheritKillAtkPct}% of the target''s attack power if the
      target is a player, or {b:InheritWeaponAtkPct}% if the target is a weapon.


      It
      may be affected by random enemy abilities or weapon enchantments.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340407
    m_Localized: Ingestion of the unhealthy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340408
    m_Localized: Consume the weapon held in your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340409
    m_Localized: starving monster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340410
    m_Localized: 'Unleash {b:MonsterCount:all} hungry beasts to automatically bite
      enemies within a radius of {b:MonsterRadius:all}m for {b:UltDuration:all} seconds,
      dealing a Gluttony attack with {b:MonsterPowerMul*100}% effect.


      If
      you kill a player with a Gluttony attack, the duration increases by {b:UltKillExtend}
      seconds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340411
    m_Localized: "The Monster has a 3-second attack cooldown per target and deals
      {b:MonsterLowHpBonus:all}% additional damage to targets with 30% or less health.\n\nDuring
      the duration, Attack Power, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed \u200B\u200Bare
      slightly increased."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340412
    m_Localized: Shadow Walker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340415
    m_Localized: 'A shadow follows the Shadow Walker.


      Whenever not in combat,
      charge <b>Darkness</b> over {b:DarkChargeTime:all} seconds.


      When attacking
      an enemy, if <b>Darkness</b> is charged, blind the target for {b:BlindTime:all}
      seconds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340417
    m_Localized: 'Activates Shadow Weapon for {b:WeaponDuration:all} seconds.


      When
      attacking with the weapon, your illusion attacks in the same direction with
      the same weapon after a short delay, dealing {b:EchoPct:all}% of the base power
      as damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340418
    m_Localized: Enemies damaged by Shadow Weapons are slowed by 10% for 1 second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340419
    m_Localized: Shadow movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340421
    m_Localized: Shadow Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340422
    m_Localized: 'Leaves a <b>Shadow Hand</b> where you are looking. If there is
      an enemy within {b:HandRadius:all}m of the <b>Shadow Hand</b>, the hand extends
      outward.


      On hit, it deals {dmg:HandCoef+HandFlat} damage and roots
      the enemy for {b:HandRoot:all} seconds.


      You can leave up to {b:HandMax:all}
      Shadow Hands on the map at a time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340423
    m_Localized: An enemy bound by a <b>shadow hand</b> within {b:HandImmune:all}
      seconds cannot be bound by another <b>shadow hand</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340426
    m_Localized: The Shadow Walker can locate all enemies within the shadow area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340427
    m_Localized: Master of Weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340428
    m_Localized: 'You are a Master of Weapons.


      Unlike other players, you
      can carry up to 8 weapons.


      Even when you are not holding them, weapons
      float beside you and fight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340429
    m_Localized: Mugu storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340430
    m_Localized: The maximum number of weapons you can carry increases to {b:SlotCount:all}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340431
    m_Localized: Master of Weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340432
    m_Localized: 'Weapons other than the one currently equipped float beside you.


      During
      combat, attack in the direction of the last enemy the player struck every {b:OrbitInterval:all}
      seconds, proportional to the weapon''s attack speed, dealing damage equal to
      {b:OrbitCoef:all} + {b:WeaponAtkPct:all}% of weapon damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340433
    m_Localized: "The maximum range is {b:OrbitRange:all}m, and firearms cannot be
      controlled by the Weapon Master.\n\nBows and staffs are based on a 100% charge
      time.\n\nSpecial enchantments on the corresponding weapon have a 50% chance
      of activating, and their values \u200B\u200Band duration are halved. (Lifesteal
      does not apply.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340434
    m_Localized: collector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340435
    m_Localized: The amount of Enchant Stones obtained is multiplied by {b:StoneGain:all}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340436
    m_Localized: command
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340437
    m_Localized: "The floating weapons rush in the direction they are facing, dealing
      damage equal to the number of weapons \xD7 {dmg:CommandCoef}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340439
    m_Localized: For {b:HasteDuration:all} seconds, the Weapon Master's base attack
      interval decreases by {b:HasteIntervalPct:all}%, and command speed increases
      by 50%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340440
    m_Localized: dancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340441
    m_Localized: 'Fires all currently floating weapons at the point you are looking
      for for {b:DancerDuration:all} seconds.


      Damage of weapons is reduced
      by up to {b:DancerCoef:all}% during this time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340443
    m_Localized: 'You are the Joker of the game.


      You always create major
      variables and possess unpredictable abilities.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340446
    m_Localized: mirth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340447
    m_Localized: Soul gain becomes {b:SoulGain:all} times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340448
    m_Localized: Joker Draw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340449
    m_Localized: Teleports backward, leaving a Joker card at the original location.
      If someone steps on the card, it explodes after a short delay, dealing {dmg:BlastCoef+BlastFlat}
      damage and slowing them by {b:BlastSlowPct:all}% for 2 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340450
    m_Localized: There can be up to {b:CardMax:all} cards at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340451
    m_Localized: One Card!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340452
    m_Localized: Adds {b:OneCardSeconds:all} seconds to the cooldown of all normal
      skills, excluding ultimates and random abilities, for all enemies within {b:OneCardRadius:all}m.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340453
    m_Localized: Substitute card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340456
    m_Localized: 'Summons an identical clone of yourself with random abilities and
      items in front of you for {b:CloneDuration:all} seconds.


      The clone
      follows the nearest enemy by default.


      When the clone dies or you press
      the Ultimate key again, it explodes, dealing {b:CloneBlastMul*100:all}% Joker
      Draw explosion to nearby enemies.


      The clone attacks enemies within
      10m with its current weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340457
    m_Localized: Clone reduces weapon damage by 50%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340458
    m_Localized: Runner's High
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340459
    m_Localized: You are very fast! But never stop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340460
    m_Localized: Runner's Qualities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340461
    m_Localized: Instead of a significant increase in speed, you take damage whenever
      you stop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340463
    m_Localized: Movement speed and health are increased, and melee weapon damage
      is significantly increased, but you can only move sideways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340464
    m_Localized: The power of the blue crab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340465
    m_Localized: Health and movement speed increase by 60%, and melee weapon damage
      increases by 100%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340466
    m_Localized: social phobia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340467
    m_Localized: If I'm within 5 meters of someone for more than 3 seconds, I get
      so embarrassed I explode!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340468
    m_Localized: Even if I have to go...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534656
    m_Localized: Kills one random player upon death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534657
    m_Localized: plural
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534658
    m_Localized: 'Upon death, you enter ''Revenge Time'' for 1 minute.


      Defeat
      the enemy who killed you during ''Revenge Time'' to gain a very powerful effect!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534659
    m_Localized: fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534660
    m_Localized: Flap flap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534661
    m_Localized: Death Regression
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534662
    m_Localized: 'Upon death, you revive immediately on the spot and reduce the Soul
      of the enemy who killed you.


      Additionally, increase the skill cooldown
      of all enemies by 8 seconds!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534664
    m_Localized: Select one player you want to have commit 'suicide' after 60 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534665
    m_Localized: Note-taking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534668
    m_Localized: Select one player and inflict the 'Curse' status on them for 20
      seconds, preventing them from communicating. Additionally, they receive a 'Seal'
      effect for up to 999 seconds while alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534670
    m_Localized: I've hated you for a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534671
    m_Localized: Acting cute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534673
    m_Localized: Acting cute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534674
    m_Localized: Ppuing ppuing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534675
    m_Localized: Storm of Time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534678
    m_Localized: Sends one target into a storm of time and space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534679
    m_Localized: Chess's giant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534680
    m_Localized: 'Collect 1 ''Pawn'' upon defeating a player.


      Collect 6 or
      more Pawns to become a ''Chess Colossus''.


      (Current Pawns {x:pawns}
      / {x:pawnsneed})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534682
    m_Localized: The pawn is promoted to become a <b>chess giant</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534683
    m_Localized: Knight's movement method
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534684
    m_Localized: Jump forward twice with the Knight's movement, and if reused within
      3 seconds, jump diagonally to the left/right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534687
    m_Localized: 'Ultimate cooldowns decrease 40% faster.


      Using Ultimate
      5 times kills half of the living players. (Current: {x:stack})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534689
    m_Localized: 50% of all life....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534690
    m_Localized: Beomgol's Will
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534691
    m_Localized: When your health drops to 1 or less, you gain massive stats for
      a short time and do not die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534692
    m_Localized: When your health drops to 1 or less, you gain massive stats for
      a short time and do not die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534693
    m_Localized: assassin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534694
    m_Localized: 'Damage dealt when the target is not looking at you increases by
      100%.


      Becomes invisible for 3 seconds when used.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534695
    m_Localized: Invisible cloak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534696
    m_Localized: 'You can decide whether to use the Cloak of Invisibility by using
      a skill.


      While using the Cloak of Invisibility, you become ''Invisible'',
      so your body (excluding weapons) is invisible, but damage dealt is reduced
      by 50%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534697
    m_Localized: Putting on a cloak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534698
    m_Localized: I hope no one finds me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534700
    m_Localized: Select one target within range, and there is a 50% chance that your
      Soul amount will become equal to that of the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534701
    m_Localized: Shall we call it a draw..?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534702
    m_Localized: Make a bet with the target you are looking at, and there is a 50%
      chance that your soul will be identical to the target's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534703
    m_Localized: Earth throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534704
    m_Localized: When used, you rise briefly, then throw 'Earth' at the spot you
      were looking at just before using the skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534705
    m_Localized: Earth throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534706
    m_Localized: 'Designate a spot in front, ascend high into the sky, and throw
      a <b>Earth</b> at that location.


      Return to the casting location after
      use.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534707
    m_Localized: Hair loss beam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534708
    m_Localized: When used, it fires a beam forward to turn the target into a 'comrade'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534709
    m_Localized: Hair loss beam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534710
    m_Localized: Make the target a 'comrade'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534711
    m_Localized: '''Allies'' cannot harm each other, and a special event occurs when
      all players become ''Allies''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534712
    m_Localized: Let's go to the future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534713
    m_Localized: 'When used, grabs one target and charges.


      No one knows where
      the destination is.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534714
    m_Localized: Let's go to the future together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534715
    m_Localized: When used, it takes one target and heads toward the future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534716
    m_Localized: Legendary Dragon Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534717
    m_Localized: 'When using a skill, you shout the Legendary Dragon Language.


      If
      you shout it 30 times, you become a legendary dragon.


      If you survive
      for 3 minutes, you win immediately.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534718
    m_Localized: Legendary Dragon Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534719
    m_Localized: His name is..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534720
    m_Localized: gliding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534721
    m_Localized: Fus Ro Da
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534722
    m_Localized: Breath of the End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534724
    m_Localized: 'Oh no! This ability has no effect.


      Try using only your
      own abilities!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340355
    m_Localized: smithy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340362
    m_Localized: 'Explodes lava within {b:FurnaceRadius}m of surroundings, dealing
      {dmg:FurnaceCoef+FurnaceFlat} damage.


      The lower the health, the stronger
      it becomes, up to {b:FurnaceMaxMul} times, and has a {b:BurnChance:pct}% chance
      to inflict burn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340368
    m_Localized: You are the Master of All Firearms. A Gunmaster can enchant all
      firearms and receives calibrations for firearms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340371
    m_Localized: Master of firearms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340381
    m_Localized: shade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340382
    m_Localized: 'A random ''Name'' is assigned.


      Additional stats and skill
      effects change depending on the ''Name''.


      Current Name : {x:nametag}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340392
    m_Localized: Scent of Death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340393
    m_Localized: Slam down a cursed sword of dark magic to deal {dmg:FinisherCoef+FinisherFlat}
      weapon damage to enemies in front, and trigger a dark magic explosion in front,
      inflicting massive poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340401
    m_Localized: Gluttony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340404
    m_Localized: spitting out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340405
    m_Localized: Can be used when you have recently killed an enemy or consumed a
      weapon with 'Gluttony'. Spits vomit forward, dealing {dmg:SpitCoef+SpitFlat}
      damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340413
    m_Localized: 'You always act with your shadow.


      Utilize your shadow to
      act aggressively, sometimes agilely, and spread it out to dominate the territory.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340414
    m_Localized: shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340416
    m_Localized: Shadow Weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340420
    m_Localized: 'Swaps positions with your shadow to teleport to the location you
      are looking at.


      You can move up to {b:MoveRange:all}m.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340424
    m_Localized: Complete darkness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340425
    m_Localized: 'Designate the surrounding area as a <b>Shadow Zone</b>, significantly
      reducing the visibility range of enemies within the zone, excluding yourself.


      Enemies
      outside the Shadow Zone cannot see inside.


      Inside the Shadow Zone,
      Shadow Walkers'' Shadow Move cooldown becomes {b:ZoneMoveCooldown:all} seconds,
      and their movement speed increases by {b:ZoneMoveSpeedPct:all}%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340438
    m_Localized: acceleration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340442
    m_Localized: joker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340444
    m_Localized: joker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340445
    m_Localized: You always have 2 random abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340454
    m_Localized: Change the cooldown of one of the random abilities currently on
      cooldown to the cooldown of the substitute card skill, and reset the cooldown
      of that random ability instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340455
    m_Localized: surprise gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945322340462
    m_Localized: blue crab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534663
    m_Localized: Death Notepad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534666
    m_Localized: I'm going to become the God of the New World!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534667
    m_Localized: Voodoo doll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534669
    m_Localized: Voodoo doll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534672
    m_Localized: Uses deadly cuteness to reduce the damage dealt by the target by
      50% for 8 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534676
    m_Localized: When used, it teleports one enemy within range to a random location!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534677
    m_Localized: We need more heroes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534681
    m_Localized: Promotion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534685
    m_Localized: inevitable existence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534686
    m_Localized: 'Ultimate cooldowns decrease 40% faster.


      Using Ultimate
      5 times kills half of the living players.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534688
    m_Localized: Finger snap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15224945326534699
    m_Localized: draw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903037960192
    m_Localized: William
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903232
    m_Localized: zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903233
    m_Localized: Thomas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903234
    m_Localized: henry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903235
    m_Localized: Robert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903236
    m_Localized: Wolf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903237
    m_Localized: Hakon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903238
    m_Localized: Eric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903239
    m_Localized: Arthur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903240
    m_Localized: "<b>Entangled Holy Sword</b> \u2014 {b:ArthurTrueRatio:pct}% of
      damage ignores armor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903241
    m_Localized: "<b>Charge</b> \u2014 Charge speed increases, and enemies hit are
      stunned for {b:ArthurStun} seconds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903242
    m_Localized: "<b>Seonghwi</b> \u2014 Deals {dmg:ArthurBlastCoef} additional damage
      in the explosion radius."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903243
    m_Localized: Roland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903244
    m_Localized: "<b>Durandal</b> \u2014 Power increases by {b:RolandBonusPct}% and
      deals additional damage equal to {b:RolandMissingPct}% of the target's missing
      health."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903245
    m_Localized: "<b>Leap</b> \u2014 Press again while mounted to jump instead of
      dashing, knocking back enemies within {b:RolandPushRadius}m and restoring {b:RolandHealMissingPct}%
      of your missing health."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903246
    m_Localized: "<b>Judgment</b> \u2014 Frontal damage increases by {b:RolandFinisherCoef}%
      of Attack Power, and enemies hit are stunned for {b:RolandStun} seconds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903079903247
    m_Localized: Bernhard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097536
    m_Localized: "<b>Final</b> \u2014 Power increases by {b:BernhardBonusPct}%, and
      targets hit become Deep Wound {b:BernhardWoundPct}% for {b:BernhardWoundTime}
      seconds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097537
    m_Localized: "<b>Wraith Charge</b> \u2014 Press again while mounted to charge
      in Ghost form, increasing the charge's power by {b:BernhardChargePct}%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097538
    m_Localized: "<b>Death Flames</b> \u2014 Inflicts massive burn on enemies hit
      by the explosion, dealing {b:DeathFlameTime}% of their maximum health every
      second for {b:DeathFlamePct} seconds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097539
    m_Localized: farmers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097540
    m_Localized: "<b>Crop</b> \u2014 Recover {b:FarmHealPct}% of damage dealt"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097541
    m_Localized: "<b>Unskilled Horseman</b> \u2014 Increased movement speed -{b:UnskilledPenalty}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097542
    m_Localized: mercenary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097543
    m_Localized: "<b>Farm</b> \u2014 Recovers {b:FarmHealPct}% of damage dealt\n<b>Combat
      Sense</b> \u2014 Shortly after, slash again with {b:SecondMul:pct}% power"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097544
    m_Localized: "<b>Unskilled Horseman</b> \u2014 Increased movement speed -{b:UnskilledPenalty}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097545
    m_Localized: Named
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15311903084097546
    m_Localized: "<b>Farm</b> \u2014 Recovers {b:FarmHealPct}% of damage dealt\n<b>Combat
      Sense</b> \u2014 Shortly after, slash again with {b:SecondMul:pct}% power"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
